Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,We notice people all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.00,0:00:08.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Someone at a cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:12.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Beside us at the airport gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:16.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Across the room at a packed party.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:20.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sometimes it's attraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:24.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sometimes it's curiosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:29.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sometimes it's just a sense\Nyou'd get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:36.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,The people who shape our lives\Noften start as strangers nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.00,0:00:46.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Radial helps you know when the interest\Nto connect is mutual with the people around you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.00,0:00:54.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,so starting the conversation feels\Nmore natural than ever before.
